window.products.push({"id":117040,"name":"Avalon Bay AB-ICE26B Ice Maker, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EOzhc2VzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Avalon Bay AB-ICE26B Portable Ice Maker, Black The Avalon Bay AB-ICE26B Portable Ice Maker is a home ice maker that produces a large amounts of ice in a short amount of time. It's lightweight and portable, the perfect accessory for parties, camping trips, and boat rides. Once it's been plugged in, the Avalon Bay AB-ICE26B can make ice in as little as six minutes, up to 26 pounds of ice a day, faster and better than a freezer ice maker. The sleek and compact design makes it a great addition to your kitchen or home bar. Special Features Include Produces 26 lbs. of ice daily Easy-to-use push button controls Makes fresh ice in as little as 6 minutes Choose from 2 ice sizes Automatic overflow protection Compact, lightweight design Makes Ice Quickly Once it's been plugged in, the Avalon Bay AB-ICE26B Portable Ice Maker will start producing ice in as little as six minutes. On its maximum settings, it can produce up to 26 pounds of ice every 24 hours. The Avalon Bay AB-ICE26B produces nine ice cubes every cycle and comes complete with an ice scoop and ice bucket that collects the ice as it's made. Easy Operation The Avalon Bay AB-ICE26B is easy to operate. Select the size of the ice cubes you want using the clearly marked push button controls, fill the water reservoir to the water line, and it's ready to begin. The ice makers comes with an indicator light that alerts you when the ice bucket is full and when the water reservoir needs to be refilled. The unit is energy efficient and eco-friendly. Any unused ice melts down into the water reservoir and gets recycled back into ice cubes. Great Design The Avalon Bay AB-ICE26B has a sleek, black finish that looks great in any setting, whether it's your kitchen, home bar, or out by the pool. The unit weighs only 20 pounds, so it's easy to carry, and it's compact - 11 inches long, 14.8 inches wide, and 14.7 inches high - which makes it easy to fit into wherever you need it. There is a drain at the bottom, so it's easy to empty and clean. Refrigerant The Avalon Bay AB-ICE26B uses environmentally-friendly R-134A refrigerant.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EOzhc2VzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NewAir","source_asin":"B07MWTNDXT","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-117040","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MWTNDXT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MWTNDXT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
