window.products.push({"id":117237,"name":"Fisher Paykel DG62T27CW2 AeroSmart 6.2 Cu. Ft. White Gas Top Load Dryer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KSb6Q370L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"AeroSmart is the perfect match to Fisher and Paykel's AquaSmart High Efficiency washer. AeroSmart is part of the family of the world's first large capacity top loading dryers. AeroSmart has autosensing to ensure clothes are evenly dried. High airflow fan speeds up the drying process. The AeroSmart dryer also has 18 Lifecycle options - pre programmed settings that give superior drying results from an Allergy cycle to a Blanket Dry cycle. Available in both electric and gas. What is SmartDrive ™? SmartDrive ™ Technology It takes a lot of brainpower to make things really simple. That, in a sentence, is the essence of SmartDrive ™. Traditional washing machines are made up of many moving parts. Their complexity also means there's a lot that can go wrong with them. Fisher & Paykel SmartDrive ™ machines are made of just three main parts: a small computer, a flexible agitator, and a simple direct-drive motor. This means washing machines that can sense each load, use less water and run with less moving parts. How SmartDrive ™ helps you. Less Moving Parts = Greater Reliability SmartDrive ™ comprises just three main parts: a small computer, a flexible agitator, and a simple direct-drive motor that allow the machines to sense each load, use less water and run with less moving parts. Precise Sensing = Better Performance In-built thermometer to precisely mix water to the required temperature. This saves power by making washing in cooler temperatures possible throughout the year. Quicker Spin = Reduces Drying Time and Cost All SmartDrive ™ washers spin to a speed of 1000rpm. They remove up to 2 1/2 litres more water per load than other washing machines, reducing drying time and drying cost.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KSb6Q370L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fisher & Paykel","source_asin":"B009T3QLMA","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-117237","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009T3QLMA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B009T3QLMA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
