window.products.push({"id":117299,"name":"NXR SC3611LP 36\" Propane Gas Range & EH3619 Under Cabinet Hood Bundle, Stainless Steel SC3611LPEHBD","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":2603.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qzCVj237L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The NXR SC model, the all stainless steel professional style gas range designed to be the centerpiece of your kitchen, bringing the look and feel of a commercial restaurant-style range into your home. Versatile Cooktop Our 36” range comes with six burners. The NXR SC offers the ultimate versatility and each burner has a purpose. Boil water quickly with the high power 18,000 BTU, simmer delicate sauces with the low power 6,000 BTU, and everything in between. Underneath it all, the NXR SC is made up of globally sourced parts selected specifically to perform. Heavy-Duty Grates Heavy-duty cast iron cooking grates compliment sealed gas burners. You can see and feel the professional style grates. The higher elevation maximizes the effectiveness of our German made burners. Slick Silver Accent Knobs Heavy duty, slick silver commercial temperature knobs with silk screen print lets you set the perfect temperature. Butterfly Broiler + Convection Cooking The oven’s broiler burner will allow you to show off your cooking abilities – exposing your food directly to high heat, searing and sealing in flavor, perfect for quickly cooking thin cuts of meat. Our Convection Fan is designed to create even cooking, producing heavenly breads, pastries and roasts.  The all stainless steel professional style NXR range hood is constructed to match the high powered BTU of professional style ranges. The key is our squirrel caged ultra-quiet motor that allows super high powered 800 CFM.  The hood comes with a 4 speed electronic button control panel, with auto shut-off. Additionally, there are high powered lights to light up your cooking experience. Our stainless steel baffle filters are all dishwasher safe, so you can keep your range hood looking sleek.  High power 800 CFM Ultra-quiet squirrel caged motor. Dishwasher safe stainless steel baffle filters 4-Speed electronic button control panel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qzCVj237L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NXR","source_asin":"B08TV2NXTH","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-117299","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TV2NXTH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TV2NXTH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
