window.products.push({"id":117417,"name":"383EER3001G 4901ER2003A Washer Shock Absorber by Beaquicy - 3 OEM PACK - 3 YEARS WARRANTY - Compatible with LG Washer - Replace 383EER3001F 383EER3001","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Fp4A1l8JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【𝟑 𝑺𝑯𝑶𝑪𝑲 𝑨𝑩𝑺𝑶𝑹𝑩𝑬𝑹𝑺 𝑨𝑵𝑫 𝟔 𝑴𝑶𝑼𝑵𝑻𝑰𝑵𝑮 𝑷𝑰𝑵𝑺】: OEM 4901ER2003A 383EER3001G Washing machine shock absorber mounted at the bottom of the tank reduces noise generation during operation, helps cushion and balance the drum and prevents the washing machine from shaking even at high operating speeds. ➤The package includes 3 x washing machine shock absorbers and 6 x mounting pins. The shock absorber is retractable and it has a maximum extension length of 11.7 inches and a minimum compression length of 7.5 inches. 【𝑷𝑳𝑨𝑺𝑻𝑰𝑪 𝑨𝑵𝑫 𝑴𝑬𝑻𝑨𝑳 𝑴𝑨𝑻𝑬𝑹𝑰𝑨𝑳】: The 4901ER2003A 383EER3001J Shock Absorbers is made of high quality plastic, metal and rubber materials for excellent durability and firmness. It is an OEM product. The upgraded shock absorbers have been upgraded in terms of the materials used to make them stronger and less likely to chip, rust or separate, making them smoother and more responsive in their shock-absorbing role and extending their service life. ➤If shock absorber is broken, the washing machine will have the FOLLOWING CONDITIONS, and the shock absorber need to be replaced in time: Washer is noisy. Crash inside the washer. Roller imbalance. 【𝑳𝑮 𝑾𝑨𝑺𝑯𝑬𝑹】: 4901ER2003A Washing Machine Shock Absorber can replacement for LG Washing Machine. ➤Replaces: 1335104, AP5226074, PS3583320, EAP3583320, 1461630, 383EER3001F, 383EER3001H, 383EER3001K, AH3522311, EA3522311, PS3522311, AP4437743, 1461630. ➤Compatible: WM3431HS, WM2016CW, WM2016CW/00, WM2016CW/01, WM3499HVA, WM3499HVA/00, WM3555HWA/00, WM1812CW, WM1814CW, WM2010CW, WM2050CW, WM2050CW/00, WM3431HW, WM3431HW/00, WM3431HW/01, WM3431HW01, WM1355HR, WM1355HW, WM1377HW, WM1388HW, WM3455HS, WM3455HW, WM3477HS, WM3477HW, WM3488HS, WM3488HS/00, WM3488HW, WM3488HW/00, etc. 【𝟑 𝒀𝑬𝑨𝑹𝑺 𝑾𝑨𝑹𝑹𝑨𝑵𝑻𝒀】: 4901ER2003A Washer Damper Assembly supports 3 YEARS return and exchange. ➤The plastic part is made of a stronger and more durable plastic material, which is more resistant to wear and tear and less likely to crack. The rubber material in the circular holes is more firmly bonded to the plastic and is less likely to separate due to frictional displacement during shock absorption. The metal part is stainless steel, which is not affected by water vapour and rusts and becomes brittle and breaks, making the shock absorber last longer. The shock absorber is able to extend and contract more smoothly, resulting in good damping. 【𝑩𝑹𝑰𝑵𝑮 𝑪𝑶𝑵𝑽𝑬𝑵𝑰𝑬𝑵𝑪𝑬 𝑭𝑶𝑹 𝒀𝑶𝑼𝑹 𝑳𝑰𝑭𝑬】: The installation of 4901ER2003A LG Washer Shock Absorber is simple. It requires no modification or adapter, plug and play. You need a screwdriver and work gloves ready. Wear gloves to protect your hands and cut off power and water before you start. Install according to the installation video on YouTube, making sure the steps are correct to prevent the installation from failing. With some time, you can replace the old shock absorber with a simple installation, and you'll save labor costs or the cost of replacing your washing machine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Fp4A1l8JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B086G864Z4","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-117417","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086G864Z4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B086G864Z4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
