window.products.push({"id":117507,"name":"Waterdrop Refrigerator Water Filter, Replacement for Bosch® 640565, Whirlpool® WHKF-R-PLUS, EVOLFLTR10, 3M® Cuno CS-52, CS-51, W1085590, 51000, 3 Filt","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HLjJG3krL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Waterdrop refrigerator filter, despite its affordable price, offers the best - a mix of prior filtration performance and important certifications from the well-known regulatory body in the industry – NSF 42 and NSF 372 certificates. [Perfect fit] You can now worry less about water leakages due to unfit or loose replacement refrigerator filters. This Waterdrop refrigerator filter replacement is made from an advanced industrial automation system and a precision measurement technology that ensures that you get the same fit as the original. Moreover, you need no tool to install this refrigerator water filter. Just follow the installation guidelines we have provided, and you will be done in minutes. [Great-tasting water] Another essential benefit of the 100% natural coconut shell carbon block is the enhanced adsorption capability. Unlike the cheap and mixed carbon block, the filter material in the Waterdrop refrigerator filter improves the overall taste of your water. [Complimentary month install stickers] You do not have to go the extra mile to monitor your refrigerator filter’s lifespan. This Waterdrop refrigerator filter is shipped with complimentary month install stickers that help track the service life at all times. Now you know when you have exhausted the 300 gallons or 6 months of pure water, depending on the water conditions. [BPA-free and food-grade materials] At Waterdrop, we prioritize your safety. This is why we have used only safe materials in this refrigerator filter, as verified by the NSF 372 certification for lead-free materials. [Purified with love] We believe everyone has the right to drink pure water wherever they are. We are not only about business; we hope to use our technology to benefit more people. A portion of every purchase you make is donated to provide children in water-scarce regions in Africa with clean, pure water. [Compatible models] 3M Cuno CS-52, CS-51, CS-450 , CS-451, CS-452, CS-512, CS-522, CS-532, CS-562, OCS CS-52, CS-51. Bosch 640565, AP3961137, 1257074, 56932, 2168701, 70020002518, W1085590, EVOLFLTR10 , B20CS5. 5553629, 55866-05, 5586605, 55866-06, 5586606. WHKFR-PLUS, WHKF-R-PLUS, WHCF-IMTOS, WHCF-IMPLUS, WHKFR Plus WHCF-R-Plus 56932, W1085590, 8668597, C00094379, C00097913, D846181. Also compatible with WSB-1, WSQ-1, Wf297, RWF1100, RFC1800A, RWF2700A, GS-BQ1, EP-CS52, SGF-BO52, WF-640565.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HLjJG3krL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WATERDROP","source_asin":"B01CA1V5MS","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-117507","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CA1V5MS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CA1V5MS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":117508,"name":"Cali Home Brew Pour Over Coffee Maker | 3 Cup/17oz Brewer | BPA Free Borosilicate Glass Carafe | Dual Layer Reusable Stainless Steel Filter | Eco Frie","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NVYEMPTNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"- CALI HOME BREW POUR OVER COFFEE MAKER - This is a morning game changer - nothing puts you in a better mood after waking up than the rich cup of delicious fresh coffee. Compared to a French press, pour over coffee tends to be smoother with less bite with the ability to pull more of the brighter notes and flavors in the coffee. But just as smooth as the coffee is the experience. From the easy assembly, thick handle for sturdy grip, and the beautiful pour through the spout, enjoy the process of making your favorite coffee from home. ADD CALI HOME BREW POUR OVER COFFEE MAKER TO YOUR CART TODAY AND START SAVING MONEY, TIME, AND THE PLANET TOO! - FEATURING - ✅ Premium Hand Blown Borosilicate Glass ✅ Dual Layer Stainless Steel Filter ✅ Easy to Clean and Dishwasher Safe ✅ Zero Waste, No Paper Needed ✅ 500mL Capacity ✅ 100% BPA Free - HOW TO BREW COFFEE LIKE A PRO WITH OUR POUR OVER COFFEE MAKER? - 1. Place the filter on glass pitcher 2. Fill dripper with your favorite coffee grounds 3. Pour hot water over the grounds, repeat a few times 4. Remove filter and enjoy! - Makes An Awesome Gift - Are any of your family or friends fellow coffee lovers? Help your loved ones have fun creating their own perfect brew and save time and money in the process - get them a gift that you know they will use! - Save Time, Save Money, & Reduce Waste! Order Yours Today! -","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NVYEMPTNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cali Home Brew","source_asin":"B075TXV7V5","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-117508","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075TXV7V5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B075TXV7V5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
