window.products.push({"id":117521,"name":"Euhomy 110V Portable Clothes Dryer 850W Compact Laundry Dryers 1.5 cu.ft Front Load Stainless Steel Electric Dryers Machine with Stainless Steel Tub f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JWKUm4SQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Powerful Power】The portable dryer is compact and portable, but with 850W power, and the electric clothes dryer has a full 10 pounds of large capacity (wet clothes). The maximum temperature is 140 ℉ to protect your and your family's skin. And the sound is so quiet when the apartment dryer is in use that it doesn't interfere with your normal conversation or sleep. Save electricity compared to other dryers. 【Compact Mini Dryer】Euhomy compact portable dryer (19.5\"*15.7\"*23.6\") is perfect for small spaces, apartments,dorm rooms,bedrooms or near home gyms,etc.The 37.5lbs weight allows the dryer machine to be easily moved anywhere in the room.And, the laundry dryer is suitable for drying baby clothes or small items of clothing, such as underwear,T-shirts, pajamas, towels,etc.This clothes dryer can be mounted on the wall, placed on a sturdy horizontal floor or mounted on a shelf (stand not included). 【Multifunctional Electric Dryer】You can set different drying modes according to different fabrics and weights. Cold (0-20 minutes): cool down, warm (30-120 minutes): dry and cool cloth, anti-wrinkle, hot (120-200 minutes): for drying large quantities or large items, air dry (0-80 minutes) run with room temperature air for freshening. Note: Use after dehydration for better drying effect. 【Enjoy the Portable Dryer】The small dryer's 105° door opening allows you to put in and take out your clothes easily. The see-through door window allows you to observe the status of your clothes at all times. If you accidentally open the door while the mini dryer is running, it will automatically stop to ensure the safety of you. In addition, the three-layer cotton filter effectively filters lint and prevents it from flying out, so even if there are pets in the house, they are no longer afraid. 【Use-friendly Design】ETL and DOE certification can guarantee the safety and quality of our portable dryer. Package includes 1 dryer, 2 hanging brackets, 2 plastic washers, 1 exhaust fitting, 4 screws 12mm long, 4 screws 25mm long, 1 manual. And we provide 1 year warranty, if you have any problem, please feel free to contact us, our professional after-sales team will try their effort to solve your problem.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JWKUm4SQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"E EUHOMY","source_asin":"B0CC5VRHVG","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-117521","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CC5VRHVG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0CC5VRHVG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
