window.products.push({"id":117591,"name":"IKAPE 58.5mm Espresso Paper Filters (200pc), Coffee Puck Screen Paper Filters Compatible with 58.5mm Portafilters Basket, Ultra Thin Replacement Paper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gPJKiZ9rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💖 New Way to Play with Extraction ☕: Our IKAPE team recently came up with a new extraction concept that uses virgin wood pulp paper filter instead of espresso puck screen. The paper filter can effectively disperse the brewing head water flow, so that the water flow can evenly contact the coffee powder, to assist the powder cake forming, does not affect the water flow pressure at the same time, effectively isolate the brewing head and coffee grounds powder. 💖 Get Your Espresso Machine Brew Head Clean ☕: This 58.5mm espresso paper filter works well to improve the channel effect, prevent coffee grounds from sticking to your espresso machine, and keep the brew head clean. Trust us, it will save you the time of cleaning the brew head when using it. Moreover, It is also compatible with all 58.5MM portafilter baskets.Sounds great!!! 💖 Easy to Take and Use ☕: Imagine it, when place the paper filter on the portafilter basket, and then use one filter paper per cup to create a mellow cup of coffee. It prevents it from being sucked up in the shower, avoiding direct contact between the ice pot and the machine's brew head. It is easy to care for and clean, simply toss them in the trash after use. Yes, you can throw them in the trash without having to pick up that dirty Parker filter paper. 💖 Handmade Log Pulp ☕: Made from natural, virgin Japanese pulp, this espresso paper filter has no chemicals and brings a new level of safety to your espresso. In addition, it exceeds the thickness of the competition by 20-30% to fit snugly in your portafilter basket, making it less likely to break even under high brewing temperatures. More important, it also comes with a premium stainless steel storage box for easier placement and removal of filter paper. 💖 Our Vision ☕: We are a brand created by a group of baristas who love espresso and we are committed to providing quality accessories and tools for perfect tasting coffee. The process of making coffee is a pleasure and an artistic experience, and it is a blessing to get a coffee that suits your taste. IKAPE would like to be the right hand of every coffee lover and warm your heart all the time. You can contact us at any time when you are unsatisfied with your puchase","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gPJKiZ9rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IKAPE","source_asin":"B0BKL5WLB8","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-117591","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKL5WLB8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKL5WLB8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
