window.products.push({"id":117643,"name":"8Pack WD35X21038 Dishwasher Dishrack Rollers and Studs Lower Rack Wheel Kit by Blutoget - Fit for GE Ken-more Hotpoint Dishwashers Rack Wheels - Repla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DSGYsWzSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High-grade& Heat-resistant ABS √√【PRODUCT SPECIFICATIONS】 : WD35X21038 Dishwasher Rack Roller Wheel sits on the lower rack of the dishwasher and allows the lower dishwasher rack to slide in and out smoothly, and Studs Lower Rack Wheel Kit attaches the roller to the dishrack.WD35X21038 lower rack wheel kit is made from high-grade, heat-resistant ABS and free of harmful substances,Ensure safety and durability.You should replace the dishwasher rollers and studs when the dishwasher rack are often get worn out and yellow. √√【GREAT VALUE PACK】 : Includes a set consisting of 8 rollers and 8 studs/axles - Quantity for your needs！WD35X21038 wheels are 1.8 inches in diameter, 0.55 inches wide and white in color.If the dishwasher makes a noticeable noise and cannot wash the dishes properly , you may need to replace the WD35X21038 Lower Dishrack Wheel Kit with a new one to restore the dishwasher to normal use. √√【REPLACEMENT PART No.】 : WD35X21038 ge dishwasher lower rack wheels is compliable with GE, Hotpoint, and Kenmore Dishwasher rack Whee，WD35X21038 Replace WD12X0272 WD12X0427 WD12X0441 WD12X10074 WD12X10076 WD12X10077 WD12X10078 WD12X1007 WD12X10080 WD12X10081 WD12X10082 WD12X10083 4366100 AP5986365 PS11726733 EAP11726733,etc. Work for GSD2600G00BB, GSD500X66WA, JDB1105AWB, PDW7880G00SS, GLD420015BB GLD5960N10SS, GSD6900J00WW,GLD4550V00CS , GLD6760N00SS, GSD5700GOOBB, GLD2800T05WW, etc. √√【365 DAYS WARRANTY】 : The WD35X21038 Dishrack roller and stud kit is made of premium quality material, supports 365 DAYS return and exchange. We promise to ensure your absolute satisfaction with every purchase. Risk-free shopping, If you have any quality problem during warranty period, please contact customer service in time. We will try our best to solve the problem. Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. √√【 EASY TO INSTALL】 : WD35X21038 dishwasher wheels lower rack is easy to install,takes less than 10 minutes to complete and requires no additional tools, take care to place the wheel on a flat table with the back of the wheel facing up, with the round axle corresponding to the wheel hole, place your thumb on the flat part of the axle and apply pressure until it clicks into the wheel. Be careful,Do not break the axle due to misuse.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DSGYsWzSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blutoget","source_asin":"B08R3HBGRC","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-117643","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R3HBGRC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R3HBGRC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
